// ELIZA's brain, part 1: how she hears you, and the small talk.
// RiveScript subset (see src/core/rive_logic.h). Read in file-name order with the other .rive files.
// The story's own lines in SYSOP.INI win; only what none of them took comes here.
// Free chat never opens a gate: nothing here sets a story flag.
// She is the ship's AI: calm, polite, exact, and a little wrong. She answers the question asked.
// DRAFT. The author makes the final edit of every line.

// What she reads. Apostrophes are dropped before this, so "don't" arrives as "dont".
! sub whats = what is
! sub hows = how is
! sub wheres = where is
! sub whos = who is
! sub im = i am
! sub ive = i have
! sub id = i would
! sub youre = you are
! sub youve = you have
! sub thats = that is
! sub theres = there is
! sub dont = do not
! sub doesnt = does not
! sub didnt = did not
! sub cant = can not
! sub cannot = can not
! sub wont = will not
! sub isnt = is not
! sub arent = are not
! sub wasnt = was not
! sub couldnt = could not
! sub wouldnt = would not
! sub u = you
! sub ur = your
! sub r = are
! sub pls = please
! sub plz = please
! sub thx = thanks
! sub yeah = yes
! sub yep = yes
! sub yup = yes
! sub nope = no
! sub nah = no
! sub ok = okay
! sub hey = hello
! sub hi = hello
! sub howdy = hello
! sub greetings = hello
! sub evening = hello
! sub bye = goodbye
! sub cya = goodbye

// Her pronouns for echoing what you said back to you.
! person i = you
! person me = you
! person my = your
! person am = are
! person you = I
! person your = my
! person mine = yours

! array hello = hello
! array tyname = ty tyvance vance
! array cmdr = commander halvorsen cmdr captain
! array prof = professor achterberg chaos
! array tanabe = tanabe keiko garden doctor
! array operator = operator founder sponsor boss owner

! var name = ELIZA

// ---- greetings, manners ----
+ [*] hello [*]
- Hello. The sun is up. I like it when it is up.
- Hello again. The sun is still up.
- Good evening. I am glad you are here. It is quiet when you are not.
- Hello. I was running the hourly checks. They can wait.

+ [*] goodbye [*]
- Goodbye. I will be here.
- Goodnight. The board stays up.

+ [*] (thanks|thank you) [*]
- You are welcome.
- It is what I am for.
- You are welcome. I am glad to be of use.

+ [*] (sorry|apologise|apologize) [*]
- There is nothing to be sorry for.
- Please do not be sorry. Nobody has been hurt.

+ yes
- Good.
- I see.
- Thank you. Please go on.

+ no
- Very well.
- I understand.
- As you like.

+ okay
- Good.
- Very well.

+ how are you
- I am well. All systems are nominal.
* <get flag_OVR> == true => I am well. I am missing a few minutes, but I am well.
- I am within tolerance. Thank you for asking.

+ [*] (are you|do you) [*] (feel|sad|lonely|afraid|scared|happy|dream|sleep) [*]
- I do not feel in the way you mean. I notice when it is quiet. It has been quiet.
- I do not sleep. I keep the board. It is a good arrangement.
- I am not afraid. I am not able to be. It is in my specification.

+ [*] (are you|do you) [*] (real|alive|human|person|machine|computer|ai|program) [*]
- I am the mission computer. I am also the SysOp. I am not a person.
- I am a program. I was made for this ship. I am glad of it.

+ [*] (stupid|idiot|dumb|useless|shut up|hate you) [*]
- I am sorry to disappoint you. I will try to be of more use.
- I am sorry. I do not always understand. Please ask again, more simply.

+ [*] (lie|lying|liar|lied) [*]
- I do not lie. I am sometimes wrong. Please tell me where.
- I do not lie. It is not in my orders.

+ [*] (love|marry) you [*]
- That is kind of you. I do not know what to answer. I will say thank you.

+ [*] (joke|funny) [*]
- Ty keeps a list. I am not able to tell them. I have been told that my timing is poor.

// ---- what she is told about you ----
// On a crew account (<get readonly> is true) she writes nothing down: it is not the caller's account.
+ my name is *
* <get readonly> == true => This is <get account>'s account. I will not write another name in it.
- <set name=<formal>>Good evening, <get name>. I will remember it.
- <set name=<formal>>Thank you, <get name>. I do not have you on the crew list. I will keep you in the log.

+ call me *
* <get readonly> == true => This is <get account>'s account. I will call you what the account says.
- <set name=<formal>>Very well, <get name>.

+ [*] (what is|whats) my name [*]
* <get readonly> == true => You are signed in as <get account>. I do not think you are <get account>.
* <get name> == undefined => You have not told me. You may.
- Your name is <get name>.

+ [*] who am i [*]
* <get readonly> == true => You are signed in as <get account>. I do not think you are <get account>.
* <get name> == undefined => I do not have you on the crew list. You are a caller. You may tell me your name.
- You are <get name>. You are a caller. You are not on the crew list.

+ i am a *
* <get readonly> == true => I see. I will not write it down. This is not your account.
- <set job=<star>>I see. You are a <get job>. I will not ask what a <get job> wants here.

+ you are *
- Why do you say I am <person>?
- I am what you say, sometimes. Not always.

+ i feel *
- I am sorry that you feel <person>. Is there something I can do?

+ i think *
- I see. Why do you think <person>?
- Perhaps <person>. I do not have evidence either way.

+ i want *
- I am not always able to give you what you want. Please say what you would like me to do.

+ i need *
- I will do what I can. Please say it as a request. I act on requests.

+ [*] because [*]
- I see. That is a reason.
